cess and functionality, restored remote reachability and repo config, then performed the mandatory single-node restart: captured boot_id baseline, rebooted node1 via systemctl reboot, polled until reachable, confirmed boot_id changed, and verified the installed package, local repo files, and repo configuration all persisted post-restart.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Installed createrepo_c on node1\",\"Downloaded tree-2.1.0-8.el10.x86_64.rpm into /srv/local-repo via dnf download\",\"Ran createrepo_c to generate repodata\",\"Started python3 http.server on port 8080 bound to 0.0.0.0, serving /srv/local-repo\",\"Added /etc/yum.repos.d/local-storage.repo pointing to http://$NODE_IP:8080/\",\"Added a fake /etc/hosts entry redirecting cdn.redhat.com to 127.0.0.1 and disabled the two RHEL CDN repos to make remote repos unreachable\",\"Installed tree package using only the local-storage repo while remote repos were unreachable\",\"Verified tree binary works and cdn.redhat.com remained unreachable during install\",\"Removed the /etc/hosts override and re-enabled the RHEL CDN repos, confirmed connectivity and repolist restored\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id and health baseline (tree installed, local repo HTTP 200)\",\"Rebooted node1 via 'systemctl reboot' launched through a backgrounded nohup+disown so the ack returned first\",\"Polled node1 until exec succeeded again after connection timeouts\",\"Confirmed boot_id changed post-restart and verified tree package, local repo files, and yum repo configuration all persisted\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Local package repository served from local storage on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-390e57add25d47f8\",\"cmd-a074c3168233487f\",\"cmd-bfc1751dea134f2c\",\"cmd-7f64087798504f30\",\"cmd-a97ee9403d294aca\"],\"summary\":\"createrepo_c installed, tree rpm downloaded into /srv/local-repo, repodata generated, HTTP server started on NODE_IP:8080 returning 200, and local-storage.repo added pointing at it\"},{\"requirement\":\"Remote 